SUMMARY:HSPCA Pinball Fundraiser- Flippers & Puppers
DTSTAMP:20260730T055153Z
DTSTART:20260731T173000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us as we raise funds for puppies by playing pinball! We’ll
	 be partnering with the HSPCA for this play in tournament\, where you can 
	go head to head in a flipper style competition\, while drinking beer\, and
	 donating to a great cause. $20 buy in and $2 off beers for participants!\
	n\nhttps://www.eurekaheights.com/event/hspca-pinball-fundraiser-flippers-p
	uppers-2026-07-31/\n\nFrom Eureka Heights Brewery
